728558044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Non-Recyclable Foes</h2><br>An enemy army won\u2019t twiddle its metallic thumbs and wait. Do you turtle up defenses and risk losing momentum? Or run the razor-thin edge to victory, capturing just enough to keep the pressure on? Fortify each territory with turrets and upgrade leading bot to field a small, elite army? Perhaps try to attempt massive attacks of cheap, expendable robots? The quantity has a quality of its own.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866640/extras/9d793328925102cea793dd98b17cf69f.poster.avif?t=1728558044\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866640/extras/9d793328925102cea793dd98b17cf69f.webm?t=1728558044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866640/extras/9d793328925102cea793dd98b17cf69f.mp4?t=1728558044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skills to Master</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866640/extras/551c40433a71b77ddf66c2f19635b125.poster.avif?t=1728558044\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866640/extras/551c40433a71b77ddf66c2f19635b125.webm?t=1728558044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866640/extras/551c40433a71b77ddf66c2f19635b125.mp4?t=1728558044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There are no starting builds or advantages - the battlefield determines who is left. Master 5 main weapons, defensive emplacements, and robot builds. \u0421hallenge friends to a round of wholesome robotic slaughter!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_